<title>USA: Granite Financial has new credit pact.</title>
<headline>Granite Financial has new credit pact.</headline>
<dateline>WESTMINSTER, Colo. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Granite Financial Inc said Monday it had entered into a $36 million revolving line of credit.</p>
<p>Granite said the new credit facility is comprised of a consortium of lenders that include CoreStates Bank of Philadelphia serving as agent, Colorado National Bank of Denver, PNC National Bank of Philadelphia, and Bank Leumi of New York.</p>
